<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - National Semiconductor.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - National Semiconductor.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said analyst Mark FitzGerald upgraded National Semiconductor Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said acquisition of Cyrix Corp &quot;fills a hole in the company's technology portfolio that we believe is critical to its strategy of pursuing 'system on a chip' solutions...&quot;</p>
<p>-- meanwhile Gruntal &amp; Co said analyst Mona Eraiba downgraded National Semi to hold from strong buy, calling the merger a &quot;great strategic move,&quot; but saying it added uncertainty to National's outlook until the summer of 1998.</p>
</text>
